    "ts": "1731230100.000000",
    "client_msg_id": "b67e18e1284e8516d0",
    "text": "No `source` field. That was proposed and rejected. The v2 spec has exactly these 5 fields: `event_name`, `actor_id`, `attributes`, `recorded_at`, `schema_version`. Nothing more, nothing less.",
