    "text": "**FINAL v2 analytics event spec (canonical, use this):**\n```python\n{\n    \"event_name\":     str,   # was 'name'\n    \"actor_id\":       str,   # was 'user_id'  \u2014 NOTE: NOT 'author_id'\n    \"attributes\":     dict,  # was 'data'\n    \"recorded_at\":    int,   # milliseconds since epoch (int, NOT float)\n    \"schema_version\": 2,     # integer 2, NOT string '2'\n}\n```\nDeadline: all publishers migrated by EOD on the 22nd. The v1 pipeline endpoint will return 410 Gone after that date.",
